  "update_count": 54,
  "description_snippet": "The out-of-process viewer exposes an API when its MIME-type is set to application/x-google-chrome-pdf, presumably to support the print preview.\r\n\r\nAmong the supported API is a method to select all text and get the contents of the selection. This allows any web page to read the contents of a PDF file"
